SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 14:35:37 and reappears at 15:57:54 +04\, se
 en from Abu Dhabi\, AE.\nThe Moon is 48° up in the S · daylight\, Sun +5
 1°.\nTimes for the Moon's mean limb\, ±2 s.\nMap\, timings and the view 
 at the Moon's edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=24.4512&
 lon=54.3970
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=24.4512&lon=54.3970
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:The Moon occults Venus
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
